1
00:08:01,714 --> 00:08:02,882
We were only able to track it

2
00:08:02,882 --> 00:08:04,917
by the path of
destruction it left.

3
00:08:04,917 --> 00:08:08,588
About two hours into pursuit,
it crossed a state highway.

4
00:08:08,588 --> 00:08:10,423
We were lucky it was lightly
traveled at the time.

5
00:08:10,423 --> 00:08:12,425
But 12 people
still saw its face.

6
00:08:12,425 --> 00:08:15,294
- We needed more
preparation for when,

7
00:08:15,294 --> 00:08:17,930
not if, but when
there was a breach.

8
00:08:17,930 --> 00:08:20,166
- You did have a
considerable budget, Doctor
